## Data Fetching Patterns

### Server-Side Data (SSR/SSG)
**RECOMMEND for SEO-critical data:**

```dart
class BlogPage extends StatelessComponent {
  @override
  Iterable<Component> build(BuildContext context) sync* {
    // Data fetched on server - good for SEO
    final posts = await ApiService.fetchPosts();
    
    yield div([
      ...posts.map((post) => PostCard(post: post)),
    ]);
  }
}
```

### Client-Side Data (Interactive)
**RECOMMEND for user-specific data:**

```dart
class DynamicContent extends StatefulComponent {
  @override
  State<DynamicContent> createState() => _DynamicContentState();
}

class _DynamicContentState extends State<DynamicContent> {
  List<Item> items = [];
  bool isLoading = true;

  @override
  void initState() {
    super.initState();
    _loadData();
  }

  Future<void> _loadData() async {
    try {
      final data = await ApiService.fetchUserData();
      setState(() {
        items = data;
        isLoading = false;
      });
    } catch (e) {
      setState(() => isLoading = false);
      // Handle error
    }
  }

  @override
  Iterable<Component> build(BuildContext context) sync* {
    if (isLoading) {
      yield div([text('Loading...')]);
      return;
    }

    yield div([
      ...items.map((item) => ItemCard(item: item)),
    ]);
  }
}
```

## State Management Recommendations

### Decision Matrix
**GUIDE users based on complexity:**

1. **Built-in State (setState)** - RECOMMEND for:
   - Simple forms
   - Local component state
   - Toggle states, counters

2. **Riverpod** - RECOMMEND for:
   - Shared state between components
   - Complex business logic
   - API data caching

### Riverpod Setup
**WHEN user needs global state:**

```dart
// 1. Add dependency
dart pub add jaspr_riverpod

// 2. Create providers
final counterProvider = StateProvider<int>((ref) => 0);

// 3. Use ConsumerWidget
class CounterDisplay extends ConsumerWidget {
  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context, WidgetRef ref) {
    final count = ref.watch(counterProvider);
    return div([text('Count: $count')]);
  }
}
```

