**ALWAYS ensure users implement these for SEO:**

### 1. Meta Tags
```dart
yield Document(
  title: 'Page Title',
  meta: {
    'description': 'Page description for search engines',
    'og:title': 'Social media title',
    'og:description': 'Social media description',
